[Music]  Carlos Seville may have been born on the  Isle of the lost but he doesn't have a  bad bone in his body he's come a long  way from being the timid and terrified  kid he used to be and we just can't get  over his transformation watch until the  very end to find out just how much  Carlos has evolved since we first saw  him in the original descendants film  part 1 descendants Carlos de Vil was  born and raised on the Isle of the lost  his mother Cruella De Vil had Lula for  her son and chose to manipulate him  every chance she got despite being a  super intelligent individual Carlos is  known for being somewhat gullible for  years he believed but dogs were rampant  beasts who feasted on little boys karela  instilled the spear into him when he was  just a toddler so he grew up fearing  canines above anything else Carlos is an  only child and little is known about his  father who goes unmentioned for the most  part Carlos had a very sad upbringing  and was tormented both at home and in  the outside world since Carlos is known  for being smaller and weaker than the  other decays he was often chased beat  and bullied by his peers but these  challenges were nothing compared to what  his mother did to him  for most of his life Carlos was forced  to touch up Karelas root fluff her first  scrape the bunions off her feet and  basically do whatever she asked of him  however none of this ever succeeded in  breaking Carlos's spirit which is  arguably what makes his character so  unique Carlos is tech savvy and  super-smart which is what's allowed him  to be the BK's at their own game when we  first meet Carlos in the original  descendants film he is a shell of a  person sure he likes to be wicked every  now and then but he's at his mother's  beck and call  this all changes when Prince Ben invites  Carlos who attend our Adan Prep at first  he's not too fond of the idea but as  soon as he hears karela bark out a  command he realizes that distancing  himself from mother dearest won't be  such a bad thing however his intense  fear of dogs stops him from being  excited about the whole ordeal thing  really start to change for Carlos when  he moves to auradon and realizes that  heroes aren't as bad as they seem  here Carlos is allowed to pursue his  passions which revolve around technology  video games and eating a boatload of  chocolate being the nice guy that he is  Carlos starts to make friends and even  tries joining a sports team however he  soon realizes that sports simply aren't  his forte throughout the first movie  Carlos demonstrates just how smart he is  by disabling the museum's alarm and  altering his 3d printer without his help  the BK's would have been sent back to  the aisle in no time still Carlos is  plagued by his mother's influence and is  terrified of canines to the point of no  return  or so we thought it's no secret that  Carlos and his friends are the best  dressed kids in auradon  thanks to Evie Carlos is always seen  wearing amazing outfits that truly  encompass his villainous background  Cruella and Carlos couldn't be any more  difference when it comes to personality  but their fashion sense is wildly  similar when it comes to Carlos's style  it's safe to say that he takes a page  from his mother's book we often see him  wearing red black and white with the  occasional hint of fur  his classic outfit is made of leather  and screams Deville his jacket has red  sleeves while its body is half white and  half black this is also the case for his  leather capris once it art on prep  Carlos swaps his leather outfit for a  more school friendly attire  however he continues to stick to karelas  colors and in good fashion Carlos tends  to keep a piece of black and white fur  attached to his hip Carlos his style  changes as he gets older but he never  strays too far from what he's used to  Carlos can easily be spotted out thanks  to his hair which is white at the tips  and black at the roots he's got a pale  complexion that is dusted with freckles  but his most appealing feature is his  wide brown eyes Carlos might come off as  wicked but he's actually super sweet in  fact he's living proof that we shouldn't  judge a book by it's cover  if there's one thing that's always held  Carlos back it's his mother Cruella  he was taught to fear dogs above  everything else which allowed her to  manipulate him but once he was far away  from her treacherous influence Carlo  began to realize that canines weren't as  bad as he was led to believe while  training with the future king of our Don  Carlos was chased by the school mutt  what was supposed to help him improve  his speed turned into a total nightmare  dude the dog chased Carlos into the  forest where the VK attempted to climb a  tree to escape mutilation this is when  Prince van realized just how hard the  BK's had it back home then helped Carlos  realize that dogs were friendly  creatures who were known as man's best  friend he encouraged Carlos to get to  know dude which changed his life for the  better then and there Carlos realized  that his mother had been lying to him  for his entire life this revelation  helped Carlos sever ties with his mother  so when Carlos chatted with his mother  via webcam on family day  he stood up to her for the very first  time his newfound courage changed him  for the better by overcoming his fear of  dogs  Carlos was truly able to make peace with  his past and move on to a brighter  future so when it was time to steal  fairy godmothers wand  Carlos chose to be good as long as he  never had to see Mommy Dearest again  part two descendants - in descendants -  Carlos and his friends are no longer on  probation when it comes to attending our  Don prep Carlos is now a dog lover who's  no longer ruled by his mother's wicked  ways instead he's focused on trying to  improve his own life for the very first  time  although dude the dog is a free mutt who  doesn't have an owner he can be found by  Carlos's side both day and night Carlos  now has amazing friends a happy living  situation and a pet dog but something is  still missing from his life we learned  early on that Carlos is crushing on  fairy godmothers daughter Jane Carlos  asks Jay for dating advice but soon  regrets it because Jay doesn't yet know  what it means to fall in love all Carlos  wants is to be able to talk to Jane  without fumbling over his words he also  wants to ask her out and be her dates  for the cotillion  Carlos is definitely more confident than  before but he still has a lot of work to  do  and  it comes to his feelings Carlos is far  from being an open book Carlos has  always been a nice guy and that's  something that will never change still  he was raised by villains so he's used  to taking shortcuts when it comes to  getting what he wants after trying to  tell Jane how he feels on more than one  occasion  Carlos chooses to take a simpler route  he asks mal to make him a truth gummy  with the intention of eating it and  telling Jane how he feels  however mal warns him that a truth gummy  can backfire since he'll be compelled to  tell the truth and nothing but the truth  despite the risk  Carlos chooses to bite the bullet this  just goes to show how brave and selfless  Carlos truly is he's willing to  embarrass himself in order to tell Jane  how he truly feels fortunately his plans  change when dude eats the gummy and now  returns to the Isle of the Lost it's  here that we see how brave and loving  Carlos truly is he returns to the aisle  to save his friend which is the one  place he never wanted to return to  coincidentally this unexpected adventure  brings his confidence to a whole new  level  Carlos's personality isn't the only  thing that undergoes a transformation in  descendants to the BK's wardrobe also  takes a massive turn for the better  while we're used to seeing Carlos in  white red and black Evie adds silver to  his look and it does him justice in  descendants to Carlos's hair has dyed a  silvery white his black roots are less  noticeable and he's traded in his capris  for full-length pants his leather jacket  is much more colorful than it used to be  and he's totally ditched the fur all in  all Carlos's look is much more grown-up  still he hasn't forgotten who his mother  is which is made obvious by the spots on  his jacket and the crisscross bones on  his satchel Carlos might be a good guy  but he's not about to trade his wicked  fashion sense for our gold star although  Carlos prefers a more sporty look he  knows how to dress up for the occasion  the young VK looked dashing in his  cotillion outfit which was also designed  by Evie here we see just how Carlos has  grown  in six short months he looks  sophisticated in his white and black  leather jacket white dress shirt and red  capris  he's also got red leather gloves to  match still this is just the beginning  of his coming-of-age story at first  glance Carlos appears to have it all  he's brave kind giving and has  genius-level intellect still there's one  thing Carlos could improve on and that's  his confidence coincidentally the same  can be said about Jane after saving King  been from uma and her crew the V Ches  returned to our Adan just in time for  the cotillion problem is Carlos still  doesn't have a date but after clashing  swords with the Pirates and escaping a  deadly fate old insecurities are the  least of his worries  Carlos locates Jane and asks her out but  she's talking on the phone and it's  clear that Carlos is in the friend zone  that is until he pulls her phone from  her ear and tells her he wants to take  her to the cotillion  and hopefully be more than friends this  is something the old Carlos would never  have done instead he chose to be  confident and persistent which totally  caught Jane's attention Carlos went from  being a shy and insecure person to a  go-getter in the nick of time and it's  all thanks to King been getting himself  kidnapped instead of relying on a truth  gummies to get the girl Carlos chose to  be himself and ended up winning his  crushes heart  unfortunately Carlos and Jane's romantic  adventures won't last for too long  because the dark threat is coming to our  Adan  part three descendants three it's no  secret that the vks are about to face  their biggest threat yet the third and  final installment to the descendants  franchise is set to hit the small screen  in the summer of 2019 it's safe to say  that Carlos's evolution is about to hit  a milestone Carlos may have grown  accustomed to the good life but his past  is coming back to haunt him everything  he knows and loves will be challenged  and he's bound to reach a new level of  excellence from the trailer we know that  Carlos and his friends are being  targeted by a menacing villain who will  stop at nothing to put mal in her place  but being the brave and dedicated friend  that he is Carlos will undoubtedly risk  his own life to save our Don once and  for all so far we know that Carlos evie  been dude and Jay will all be turned to  stone we also know that Jane's mother  will also meet the same fate so Carlos  will be trying to avenge his future  fairy mother-in-law while attempting to  save the world  the trailers place Carlos and some very  intense fight scenes and his character  is bound to reach new heights as this  ominous threat approaches Carlos grew up  in a very toxic setting which caused him  to doubt himself and those around him  luckily he was chosen to attend our don  prep and his personality changed for the  better the last time we saw Carlos he  was dancing the night away with his new  girlfriend Jane and it's safe to assume  that their bond has only grown since  then Carlos is now a confident hero and  a valuable ally on his quest to rid  Aradhana of evil Carlos will surely put  his tech-savvy abilities to the test  sadly we know for a fact that Carlos  isn't going to make it to the finish  line instead he'll be turned to stone  while attempting to ward off his evil  foe still we know that Carlos is going  to take a magical motorcycle ride to the  Isle of the Lost  where he'll come face-to-face with his  roots taking up arms against evil it's  no easy feat which is why only the  bravest warriors will be up for the  challenge  Carlos is going to prove just how  courageous and selfless he truly is by  risking his own life to save the masses  this just goes to show how much Carlos  has grown since we first saw him flash  across the screen as time goes on Carlos  becomes less and less  enthralled by his mother's wardrobe he  lets his hair grow long and adapt some  more futuristic style Carlos's brand-new  look is 100% appropriate though  considering he'll soon be tasked with  saving auradon when we first meet Carlos  he had a boyish charm about him but now  it's obvious that he's grown into a  young and confident man he's ditched his  predominantly red white and black attire  for a full-body silver leather suit  despite the many changes he's undergone  carlos still manages to stay true to his  heritage so his new look still mirrors  his mother's colors but to a bare  minimum  whereas Carlos used to enjoy being  decked out in red from head to toe he  now only uses crimson to fill in minor  details  Carlos's new look is downright wicked  and he looks just about ready to put up  a fight if his personality has evolved  half as much as his exterior expect to  meet a brand new Carlos come descendants  3 Carlos Deville isn't your typical  villain in fact he isn't your typical  person ever since he was a kid Carlos  chose to go against his mother's evil  ways and help those in need  in fact he once saved Evie from mouths  wicked ways despite being raised to use  hurt and ridiculed those around him  Carlos never stooped down to a villains  levels for this reason Carlos earned the  reputation of being the sweetest BK on  the aisle  Carlos's evolution is downright amazing  and it deserves some praise who would  have thought that cruella de Vil's son  would grow up to be an animal rights  activist Carlos life changed for the  better when he befriended a little dog  named dude with King Ben and Deutz help  Carlos realized that judging something  or someone on their reputation was just  as bad as spreading rumors about them  once free of his mother's cruel grasp  Carlos was finally able to pursue his  own endeavors Carlos can now shower his  girlfriend with affection play video  games and eats chocolate at will gone  are the days when Carlos slept on the  floor of his mother's fur room he's no  longer gullible and timid instead he's  realistic and brave from now on Carlos  will forever be true to his feelings and  speak his mind no matter the  consequences Carlos now sees friendship  hope and love  for what they are strengths not  weaknesses so there you have it  Carlos de Vil's evolution from start to  finish before you go let us know why you  love Carlos in the comments section  below and be sure to let us know which  descendants characters you'd like to  cover next give this video a big thumbs  up if you think do the dog is the cutest  mutt in auradon and don't forget to  subscribe to the things for the latest  descendants news thanks for watching  we'll catch you next time  [Music]

